title: "pysr3: a third-party reader, grid builder, and property mapper for CMG SR3 files"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit to read CMG SR3 result files, build PyVista grids from any
  SR3 grid family, and map spatial and time-series results onto cells and
  DataFrames.
type: software
authors:
